{{Documentation|self_doc=true}}
This template is used to display [[Cat Combo]]s.

==Usage==
<pre>
{{Combos
|{{CatCombo|name|effect|cat1|cat2|cat3|cat4|cat5|jpname=|link=|restriction=}}
|{{CatCombo|name|effect|cat1|cat2|cat3|cat4|cat5|jpname=|link=|restriction=}}
}}
</pre>
<code>link</code> is an optional parameter, if the combo has a page already it shouldn't be used (default: <code>name (Combo)</code>). <code>restriction</code> is another optional parameter for combos like [[Red Strike (Combo)]] that need a third line to show which units the combo's effect is restricted to.

The look of the table is done with [[Template:Combos]] and CSS: make sure that if using the table you have <code>class="article-table combo-table"</code> which will apply the styling seen on this page. <code>class="article-table combo-table basic"</code> will display a simplified version of the table as on pages like [[Cat Combo]].

For example usage, see Template:Combos.

